<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <title>House Inventory System - User Guide</title>
</head>
<body>
    <h1>How to Search for an Item</h1>
    <p>This section walks users through searching the inventory list for a specific item.</p>

    <h2>Steps to Search for an Item</h2>
    <ol>
        <li>Launch the application</li>
        <li>
            Locate the search bar at the top of the main page.
            <img src="/search_item1.png"
                 alt="Find search item"
                 style="width:500px; height: 600px; object-position:left; display:block;">
        </li>
        <li>
            Enter the name of the item you wish to find.
            <img src="/search_item2.png"
                 alt="Enter name of item"
                 style="width:500px; height: 600px; object-position:left; display:block;">
        </li>
        <li>Click the 'Search' button to begin searching.</li>
        <li>
            Review the inventory list to locate you item was isolated from the search.
            <img src="/search_item3.png"
                 alt="Verify search results"
                 style="width:500px; height: 600px; object-position:left; display:block;">
        </li>
    </ol>
</body>
</html>